Error [E0962]: fan-out item 1 is String (text), but the function expects Int (a whole number)
  --> tests/ui/fan_out_type_mismatch.jet:4:21
    |
  4 |     val _ = double.["a", "b"];
    |                     ^^^
 Why: each item in `f.[a, b, c]` is passed as the argument to `f`
 Fix: use Int (a whole number) here

